<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Talent promotion is meant to fuel long-term organizational growth. When the system works, it strengthens efficiency, boosts retention, and builds trust across teams. Yet many organizations struggle to identify the right leaders. Chartered Management Institute \(CMI\) data shows low managerial engagement, weak trust, and widespread mismatches in leadership roles. This is not just a global issue. It also appears in Indonesia, including within Rakamin. )
/E (Talent promotion is meant to fuel long-term organizational growth. When the system works, it strengthens efficiency, boosts retention, and builds trust across teams. Yet many organizations struggle to identify the right leaders. Chartered Management Institute \(CMI\) data shows low managerial engagement, weak trust, and widespread mismatches in leadership roles. This is not just a global issue. It also appears in Indonesia, including within Rakamin. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
