/S /H3
/T (We tested three clustering algorithms: K-Means, GMM, and K-Medoids. K-Means with K = 4 won. It has the highest Silhouette Score \(0.320\) and best DBI \(1.00\), with clear, well-separated, and compact clusters. The elbow plots confirm K = 4 is optimal. This interpretability and cluster quality make K-Means perfect for segmenting employee talent profiles.)
